[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3 uid="uid://unitmeshinstance3dskinnedtube"]

; The one variable: the tube's bone arrays and caps. The skeleton, the pose and the material are those
; of unit-mesh-instance-3d-skinned-ribbon.tscn, but the mesh is a TubeTrailMesh, whose rings blend
; between bones like the ribbon's rows and whose two caps bind to the first and the last bone, so the
; lower rings and the bottom cap swing aside with b2. No other scene skins a TubeTrailMesh.

